{"content_hash": "e2ce4d5df7866916", "version_id": 882, "article_id": 89, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Nvidia app update adds DLSS settings for 19 games", "title_zh": "英伟达应用更新，为19款游戏加入DLSS设置", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/023/068.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1719763031152-e9a4bcb12a3e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YXBwJTIwZGxzc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzOTI5NDkwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Indra Projects on Unsplash", "author": "Indra Projects", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@indraprojects?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-computer-screen-with-many-different-app-icons-S4QZnvK5Mvg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(9, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(47, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "0171d0c216a0"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-06", "word_count": 135, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Nvidia has a new version of its app. It helps 19 games look and run better. Six other games also get new settings.", "lead_zh": "英伟达推出了新版应用。它能让19款游戏画面更好、运行更顺。另外6款游戏也有了新的设置。", "preview": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds special DLSS settings for 19 games. Some of these games are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: W", "preview_zh": "新版本应用是 11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了专门的 DLSS 设置。其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》和《龙之信条2》。DLSS 能让游戏跑得更快、画面更清晰。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 865, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 55.775, "size_bytes": 335664, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 57.25, "size_bytes": 344448, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 61.1, "size_bytes": 367488, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 52.3, "size_bytes": 314784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 55.95, "size_bytes": 336672, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 159, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@315af5f/content/data/versions/882.json", "paragraphs": ["The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds special DLSS settings for 19 games. Some of these games are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt and Dragon's Dogma 2. DLSS makes games run faster and look sharper.", "Six games also get a new \"best settings\" profile. These include AION 2, Aniimo and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. The app picks good settings for each game, so players do not have to choose them alone.", "Before this update, Nvidia released two other versions. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control. Then version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark and new CPU data.", "You can find the DLSS options in the app. Go to Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. The update is free for all users of the Nvidia app."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新版本应用是 11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了专门的 DLSS 设置。其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》和《龙之信条2》。DLSS 能让游戏跑得更快、画面更清晰。", "还有6款游戏获得了新的“最佳设置”配置文件，包括《永恒之塔2》《伊莫》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。应用会为每款游戏自动选好设置，玩家不用自己一个个挑。", "在这次更新之前，英伟达还发布过两个版本。11.0.9 版加入了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建和 Resizable BAR 控制选项。之后的 11.0.9.565 版增加了对 RTX Spark 的支持和新的 CPU 数据。", "你可以在应用里找到 DLSS 选项。依次进入 Graphics（图形）、Program Settings（程序设置）、Driver Settings（驱动程序设置）。所有英伟达应用用户都可以免费更新。"], "body": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds special DLSS settings for 19 games. Some of these games are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt and Dragon's Dogma 2. DLSS makes games run faster and look sharper.\n\nSix games also get a new \"best settings\" profile. These include AION 2, Aniimo and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. The app picks good settings for each game, so players do not have to choose them alone.\n\nBefore this update, Nvidia released two other versions. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control. Then version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark and new CPU data.\n\nYou can find the DLSS options in the app. Go to Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. The update is free for all users of the Nvidia app.", "body_zh": "新版本应用是 11.0.9.585。它为19款游戏加入了专门的 DLSS 设置。其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师3：狂猎》和《龙之信条2》。DLSS 能让游戏跑得更快、画面更清晰。\n\n还有6款游戏获得了新的“最佳设置”配置文件，包括《永恒之塔2》《伊莫》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。应用会为每款游戏自动选好设置，玩家不用自己一个个挑。\n\n在这次更新之前，英伟达还发布过两个版本。11.0.9 版加入了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建和 Resizable BAR 控制选项。之后的 11.0.9.565 版增加了对 RTX Spark 的支持和新的 CPU 数据。\n\n你可以在应用里找到 DLSS 选项。依次进入 Graphics（图形）、Program Settings（程序设置）、Driver Settings（驱动程序设置）。所有英伟达应用用户都可以免费更新。", "text": "The new app is version 11.0.9.585. It adds special DLSS settings for 19 games. Some of these games are PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt and Dragon's Dogma 2. DLSS makes games run faster and look sharper. Six games also get a new \"best settings\" profile. These include AION 2, Aniimo and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. The app picks good settings for each game, so players do not have to choose them alone. Before this update, Nvidia released two other versions. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control. Then version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark and new CPU data. You can find the DLSS options in the app. Go to Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. The update is free for all users of the Nvidia app.", "vocab": [{"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本", "note": "常和数字连用，如 version 11.0.9.585", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "update", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更新", "note": "也可作动词：to update the app", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "add", "pos": "verb", "zh": "添加", "note": "add something for someone", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "settings", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设置", "note": "常用复数，指软件里的各项设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布", "note": "公司发布产品常用这个词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "support", "pos": "noun", "zh": "支持", "note": "add support for… 表示“增加对……的支持”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profile", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置文件", "note": "这里指一组预设好的设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "free", "pos": "adj", "zh": "免费的", "note": "free for all users 对所有人免费", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T01:44:48.078996", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.537, "sm": 350, "em": 537, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "app", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.8, "sm": 537, "em": 800, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "is", "s": 0.8, "e": 0.95, "sm": 800, "em": 949, "cs": 12, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "version", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.325, "sm": 950, "em": 1325, "cs": 15, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "11.0.9.585", "s": 1.325, "e": 3.6, "sm": 1325, "em": 3599, "cs": 23, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": ".", "s"